#HELPS

-1 MUDSCHOOL ADEPT "SCHOOL TRAINER" "RACIAL TRAINER" MASTER~
Mud School is up from the Temple (where RECALL lands).  From its
entrance go north, then:

  west   Eclipse's Training Room: TRAIN your stats, any class or level
  east   Soulcrusher's Guild Room: the adept PRACTICES the basic skills
         and spells with anyone

When you need more than the adept knows, see your class guildmaster or
your guild hall (GUILDS).  Trainers in Dresden open to everybody:

  Rakar the Weaponsmaster   weapon skills; sells archery, shove, despair
  Jazair the merchant       sells shove; practises bash (dwarves)
  Fingers the shopkeeper    practises hide and sneak (hobbits, elves)
  Seraloi the lost          sells ride
  Salir, Astral Plane       practises psionic powers, for those who hold
                            them (WALKTO SALIR)

Anybody may read every one of these pages; whether a trainer will teach
you depends on your class, guild and powers.

See also: TRAIN, PRACTICE, GAINLIST, GUILDS, SALIR, BEGINNERS
~

-1 JAZAIR~
Jazair the nomad merchant keeps a small trading post in Dresden (WALKTO
JAZAIR).  He sells SHOVE to anybody and practises BASH, which dwarves are
born holding.

See also: SHOVE, BASH, MUDSCHOOL
~

-1 FINGERS~
Fingers is a hobbit shopkeeper in Dresden (WALKTO FINGERS) who hides and
sneaks better than anyone.  He practises HIDE and SNEAK -- the hobbits'
and elves' birthright -- with anybody who holds them.

See also: HIDE, SNEAK, MUDSCHOOL
~

0 SALIR "PSIONIST TRAINER"~
Salir the Monk lives in a temple past the maze of the Astral Plane
(WALKTO SALIR).  He practises every psionic power, but only with those
who already hold it; he sells none.  Powers come from remorting or from
the gods (see PSIONICS), and each can be practised only from its own
level.

See also: PSIONICS, PRACTICE, REMORT
~

-1 "TEMPLE OF BREAS" BREAS~
The clerics' guild hall, on Temple Boulevard in western Dresden (WALKTO
BREAS).  Only members may enter.

  Dominic    full clerics: attack, healing, cleric protective
  Eriak      full clerics: harmful, cleric maladictions, cleric
             transportation (in the cellars)
  Tempora    full clerics: benedictions, cleric elemental, concoct
  Fredar     other classes: guild attack, guild transportation, second
             attack, shield block
  Grill      other classes: guild healing, guild benedictions, guild
             maladictions
  Lunk       other classes: guild elemental, guild harmful, guild
             protective
  Silius     any member: detection, creation, weather, meditation, wands,
             staves
  Qualo      any member: curative, dodge; practises resurrection

GAINLIST is always the current word on what you can buy and from whom.

See also: GUILDS, GAINLIST, SPELLGROUP, CLERICS
~

-1 CLERICS DAVID~
Clerics are healers and protectors first, with weaker attack spells than
mages.  They start with maces, staves, scrolls and basic detection,
curing, cause, blessing and protective spells; flamestrike grows with
their level.

Anybody who joins the clerics' guild gets a similar free set, with
RESURRECTION.  Clerics in another guild learn their class's spells from
David, the missionary of Devota, who wanders Dresden (WALKTO DAVID).
Full clerics train at the TEMPLE OF BREAS.

See also: GUILDS, TEMPLE OF BREAS, SPELLGROUP
~

-1 "CITADEL OF WAR" CITADEL~
The warriors' guild hall, off Battle Road in eastern Dresden (WALKTO
CITADEL).  Only members may enter.

  Vladamir   full warriors: destruction, third attack, door bash, smite
  Geko       any member: bash, berserk, dirt kicking, dodge, shield block
  Dolonar    any member: disarm, dodge, enhanced damage, rescue, parry
  Breark     any member: hand to hand, kick, second attack, fast
             healing, danger sense

Vladamir, Dolonar and Breark also practise HEROIC GRIP.  GAINLIST is
always the current word on what you can buy and from whom.

See also: GUILDS, GAINLIST, WARRIOR
~

-1 "RAKAR THE WEAPONSMASTER" RAKAR~
Rakar the Weaponsmaster wanders Dresden (WALKTO RAKAR).  He practises
every weapon skill with anybody, and sells ARCHERY, SHOVE and DESPAIR to
any class.

See also: WEAPON, ARCHERY, SHOVE, DESPAIR
~

-1 WARRIOR KALAK BLACKSMITH~
Warriors are the best fighters and use no magic of their own.  They
start with swords, shield block, parry, kick, rescue and disarm, and
their weapon blows grow every level (WEAPON MASTERY), most in the
warriors' guild.

Anybody who joins the warriors' guild gets SECOND ATTACK free.  Warriors
in another guild learn their class's skills from Kalak, the dwarven
blacksmith off Market Square (WALKTO KALAK).  Full warriors train at the
CITADEL OF WAR.

See also: GUILDS, CITADEL OF WAR, WEAPON MASTERY
~

-1 "HOUSE OF THIEVES" HOUSE~
The thieves' guild hall, off River Road in Dresden (WALKTO THIEVES).
Only members may enter.

  Mizry         full thieves: fatality, stealth, dual wield, track
  Ni Hi         any member: backstab, dirt kicking, second attack, trip
  Quickfingers  any member: steal, peek, search, aggrostab
  Picky         any member: pick lock
  Stout         any member: parry, lore
  Suma          any member: haggle, sleight of hand, dodge
  Warder        any member: hide, sneak, listen at door

GAINLIST is always the current word on what you can buy and from whom.

See also: GUILDS, GAINLIST, THIEF
~

-1 THIEF TIA~
Thieves work by stealth: sneaking, hiding, picking locks and striking
from behind.  They start with daggers, sneak, pick lock, steal, search,
backstab, hide and dodge, and their weapon blows grow every level
(WEAPON MASTERY), most in the thieves' guild.

Anybody who joins the thieves' guild gets TRIP free.  Thieves in another
guild learn their class's skills from Tia, the ninja master, who hides
near River Road (WALKTO TIA).  Full thieves train at the HOUSE OF THIEVES.

See also: GUILDS, HOUSE OF THIEVES, BACKSTAB
~

-1 "UNIVERSITY OF MAGIC" UNIVERSITY~
The mages' guild hall, in north-west Dresden (WALKTO UNIVERSITY).  Only
members may enter.

  Danko     full mages: mage protective, enchantment, beguiling
  Drixt     full mages: draconian, mage elemental, scribe (dungeon)
  Flame     full mages: combat, mage maladictions, concoct, second attack
  Tranis    full mages: mage transportation, enhancement
  Chamis    other classes: guild protective, guild transportation
  Creole    other classes: guild beguiling, guild enhancement
  Kilar     other classes: guild combat, guild elemental, guild
            maladictions
  Diemos    any member: detection, weather, meditation, staves, wands,
            dodge, second attack
  Dawn      any guild: arcane studies, scribe; practises wands, staves
            and scrolls

GAINLIST is always the current word on what you can buy and from whom.

See also: GUILDS, GAINLIST, SPELLGROUP, MAGE
~

-1 MAGE "MAGIC USER" GIOLI~
Mages have the strongest attack magic and the weakest bodies.  They
start with daggers, wands, scrolls, magic missile and other basic
attack, protective and detection spells, and fly; lightning bolt grows
with their level.  Only full mages buy the draconian and enchantment
groups.

Anybody who joins the mages' guild gets a similar free set of spells,
with wands and scrolls.  Mages in another guild learn their class's
spells from Gioli, the gnome magician, who wanders Dresden (WALKTO
GIOLI).  Full mages train at the UNIVERSITY OF MAGIC.

See also: GUILDS, UNIVERSITY OF MAGIC, SPELLGROUP
~

-1 SERALOI "LOST MAGE"~
Seraloi the lost has come to Dresden looking for his long-lost brother,
Gioli.  While he searches he sells RIDE to anybody (WALKTO SERALOI).

See also: RIDE, MUDSCHOOL
~

-1 "PALMS OF THE CREATOR" PALMS~
The monks' guild hall, reached by a path south of Temple Road near
Dresden's west gate (WALKTO PALM).  Only monks may enter.

  The Silent Master       nerve damage, steel fist, stunning blow, fast
                          healing, hand to hand, kick, dodge, parry, dirt
                          kicking, enhanced damage
  The Master of Movement  blinding fists, crane dance, fists of fury,
                          iron skin, levitate, herbal brewing, disarm,
                          meditation, second attack, bash

GAINLIST is always the current word on what you can buy and from whom.

See also: MONK, GUILDS, GAINLIST
~

-1 MONK~
Monks fight with their bare hands and a trained mind.  They start with
hand to hand, dodge, meditation, kick, trip and nerve damage, and learn
their martial arts at the PALMS OF THE CREATOR.  Monks must be human or
dwarf, belong to their own guild, and cannot join another; nobody else
may join theirs.

See also: PALMS OF THE CREATOR, GUILDS, NERVE DAMAGE
~

-1 "MORGUE OF DRESDEN" MORGUE~
The necromancers' guild hall, just inside Dresden's southern wall (WALKTO
MORGUE).  Only necromancers may enter.

  The Necro Guild Master    necromancy, necro maladictions (beware the
                            sacrificial pit)
  The Soul Trapper          life & undeath, necro protective, wands
  The Undead Spirit         necro transportation, scrolls, scribe
  Marilith                  necro elemental, necro enhancement, concoct
  The Necromantic Warrior   dodge, meditation, staves

GAINLIST is always the current word on what you can buy and from whom.

See also: NECROMANCER, GUILDS, LIFE-UNDEATH
~

-1 NECROMANCER~
Necromancers work the black arts: undead servants, curses and the
energies of the dead.  They start with daggers, wands, scrolls and the
NECROMANCY group, and train at the MORGUE OF DRESDEN.  Necromancers must
be human or elf, belong to their own guild, and cannot join another;
nobody else may join theirs.

See also: MORGUE OF DRESDEN, LIFE-UNDEATH, CREATE SKELETON
~

0 $~

